OL,3,GNEWSANew Welsh constituency names could
OL,4,Abe changed - again
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew constituency names in Wales - used
OL,7,Ffor the first time in this May's Senedd
OL,8,Felection - are going to be reviewed and
OL,9,Fpossibly changed.
OL,11,FIt means the 16 constituencies could
OL,12,Fsee changes to Welsh-only names that
OL,13,Fproved unpopular, with any amendments
OL,14,Fset to be in place by the 2030
OL,15,Felection.
OL,17,FDemocracy and Boundary Commission Cymru
OL,18,Fchief executive Shereen Williams said
OL,19,Fthe review would ensure constituencies
OL,20,Freflected the communities they serve,
OL,21,Fincluding cultural heritage and Welsh
OL,22,Flanguage use.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
