OL,3,GNEWSANew Welsh constituency names could
OL,4,Abe changed - again
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 2025 review paired UK parliamentary
OL,7,Fconstituencies - for MPs - and former
OL,8,FWelsh Senedd areas to create 16 new
OL,9,Fconstituencies for May's Senedd
OL,10,Fexpansion, with six Members of the
OL,11,FSenedd representing each.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
